---
import {MapPin, Phone} from "lucide-react"
---
<section id="contatti" class="relative w-full bg-white py-14 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 border-b border-zinc-200 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-600">
                Come trovarci
            </span>
            <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
                I nostri contatti
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base text-zinc-600">
                Contattaci per qualsiasi richiesta di intervento a domicilio su porte blindate, serrande, inferriate e
                casseforti.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10">

            <div class="bg-zinc-950 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-zinc-800 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors flex flex-col items-center text-center">
                <div class="bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-500/25 w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 mb-4">
                    <Phone className="w-6 h-6"/>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-zinc-400 mb-1">Telefono</h3>
                <a
                        href="tel:+393333107476"
                        class="text-lg font-extrabold text-white hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors"
                >
                    333 310 7476
                </a>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500">
                    Il numero WhatsApp per l'invio foto viene indicato durante la chiamata
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-zinc-950 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-zinc-800 hover:border-amber-400 transition-colors flex flex-col items-center text-center">
                <div class="bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-500/25 w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 mb-4">
                    <MapPin className="w-6 h-6"/>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-zinc-400 mb-1">Zona di Intervento</h3>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Monza e Brianza (MB)</p>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Milano e Province (MI)</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-400">Interventi a domicilio su chiamata</p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="bg-zinc-950 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-zinc-800 text-center sm:text-left flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Hai bisogno di un fabbro?</h3>
                <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm">
                    Chiamaci per spiegare la richiesta, inviare eventuali foto su WhatsApp e ricevere il preventivo.
                </p>
            </div>
            <a
                    href="tel:+393333107476"
                    class="group inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto shrink-0 items-center justify-center space-x-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-yellow-500 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-yellow-400 px-8 py-4 text-base font-extrabold text-zinc-950 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 active:scale-95 transition-all"
            >
                <div class="p-1.5 bg-zinc-950/15 rounded-xl group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform">
                    <Phone className="w-5 h-5"/>
                </div>
                <span>Chiama il 333 310 7476</span>
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>